[402.298221, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  The key finding worth flagging: \u001b[38;5;153m\u001b[1mmy-cv\u001b[39m is empty\u001b[22m — no files, not even a git repo — so there was no codebase to analyze. I wrote the\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  CLAUDE.md\u001b[13Gfrom\u001b[18Gyour\u001b[23Gplan\u001b[28Ginstead,\u001b[37Gencoding\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gparts\u001b[56Ga\u001b[58Gfresh\u001b[64GClaude\u001b[71Ginstance\u001b[80Gcan't\u001b[86Gdiscover\u001b[95Gfrom\u001b[100Gnon-existent\u001b[113Gfiles:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[402.298442, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;220m⏵⏵\u001b[6Gauto\u001b[11Gmode\u001b[16Gon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[30Gto\u001b[33Gcycle)\u001b[40G·\u001b[42Gesc\u001b[46Gto\u001b[49Ginterrupt\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?25h"]
[403.079968, "o", "\u001b]0;⠂ Claude Code\u0007"]
[403.730231, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  - \u001b[1mThe three pillars\u001b[22m (ORCID sync, YAML database, LaTeX/PDF generation) and, more importantly, the architectural insight that the \u001b[1mYAML \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[1mschema is the center of gravity\u001b[35G\u001b[22m—\u001b[37Gboth\u001b[42Gsync\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Ggeneration\u001b[62Gread\u001b[67Git,\u001b[71Gso\u001b[74Gschema\u001b[81Gchanges\u001b[89Gripple\u001b[96Gboth\u001b[101Gways.\u001b[107GThat's\u001b[114Gthe\u001b[118G\"big\u001b[123Gpicture\"\u001b[132Ga\r\u001b[1B  future instance would otherwise have to reverse-engineer.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m──────────────────────────"]
[403.730444, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;220m⏵⏵\u001b[6Gauto\u001b[11Gmode\u001b[16Gon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[30Gto\u001b[33Gcycle)\u001b[40G·\u001b[42Gesc\u001b[46Gto\u001b[49Ginterrupt\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?25h"]
[404.041254, "o", "\u001b]0;⠐ Claude Code\u0007"]
